Fixed the cubic run time of :meth:`Timezone.get_transitions <icalendar.cal.timezone.Timezone.get_transitions>` for a ``VTIMEZONE`` with many equal ``STANDARD`` or ``DAYLIGHT`` subcomponents without ``TZNAME``, which made parsing such a calendar with the ``pytz`` timezone provider slow. A repeated name now gets a numeric suffix such as ``_2`` instead of another ``_1``. I used AI to assist me with this change. @shamsManna
